>> YOU WANNA TAKE THE RIDE HOME?

820
00:20:15,582 --> 00:20:16,583
OKAY.

821
00:20:16,583 --> 00:20:17,584
>> LIKE, MY HEART AND MY MIND--

822
00:20:17,584 --> 00:20:18,585
IT'S LIKE, "BE HERE

823
00:20:18,585 --> 00:20:19,586
AND STAY AND DO THIS."

824
00:20:19,586 --> 00:20:20,587
BUT MY BODY IS LIKE,

825
00:20:20,587 --> 00:20:22,823
"YOU CAN'T,"

826
00:20:22,823 --> 00:20:27,895
AND IT SUCKS SO BAD.

827
00:20:27,895 --> 00:20:29,229
>> DANIELLE ON SEASON SIX--

828
00:20:29,229 --> 00:20:30,230
SHE WAS REALLY, REALLY SICK,

829
00:20:30,230 --> 00:20:31,231
HAD I.V.s IN HER ARM--

830
00:20:31,231 --> 00:20:32,232
AND INSTEAD OF, YOU KNOW,

831
