839
00:20:41,909 --> 00:20:45,612
AND TAKE A LOOK AT THE RUNWAY.

840
00:20:45,612 --> 00:20:46,613
>> LET'S DO IT!

841
00:20:46,613 --> 00:20:47,614
>> WHOO!

842
00:20:47,614 --> 00:20:48,615
WHOO!

843
00:20:48,615 --> 00:20:49,616
>> OH!

844
00:20:49,616 --> 00:20:50,617
>> WE LOOK,

845
00:20:50,617 --> 00:20:51,618
AND THERE'S THIS RUNWAY

846
00:20:51,618 --> 00:20:52,619
RIGHT IN THE MIDDLE OF A POOL.

847
00:20:52,619 --> 00:20:54,454
WE'RE LIKE, "OH, MY GOD."

848
00:20:54,454 --> 00:20:55,455
>> SO IT'S--IT'S, AGAIN,

849
00:20:55,455 --> 00:20:56,456
TO ENTICE THE AUDIENCE,

850
00:20:56,456 --> 00:20:57,457
TO MAKE IT SOMETHING NEW,

851
00:20:57,457 --> 00:20:58,458
SOMETHING SPECIAL.

852
00:20:58,458 --> 00:20:59,993
>> AND WE'RE LIKE...

853
00:20:59,993 --> 00:21:01,628
"IN THE POOL?

854
00:21:01,628 --> 00:21:02,629
ARE YOU KIDDING ME?!"

855
00:21:02,629 --> 00:21:03,931
>> I'VE WALKED IT ALL AFTERNOON,

856
00:21:03,931 --> 00:21:05,632
AND CLEARLY, I'M FINE.

857
00:21:05,632 --> 00:21:06,767
SO WE READY TO FIT OUR CLOTHES?

858
00:21:06,767 --> 00:21:07,834
>> YEAH!

859
00:21:07,834 --> 00:21:08,835
>> OKAY, LET'S GO.

860
00:21:08,835 --> 00:21:10,037
THIS IS NOT UNREALISTIC.

