TO DO ALMOST ANYTHING

863
00:21:13,106 --> 00:21:15,842
TO SELL A GARMENT.

864
00:21:15,842 --> 00:21:16,843
>> I'M GONNA ROCK IT TODAY

865
00:21:16,843 --> 00:21:17,844
ON THE RUNWAY.

866
00:21:17,844 --> 00:21:18,845
I'M GONNA KEEP THAT ADRENALINE

867
00:21:18,845 --> 00:21:21,782
THAT I HAD YESTERDAY AND USE IT.

868
00:21:26,887 --> 00:21:29,690
>> ALL RIGHT, WE READY?

869
00:21:29,690 --> 00:21:31,692
THIS IS FIERCE?

870
00:21:31,692 --> 00:21:33,093
I'M WAITING FOR FIERCE.

871
00:21:33,093 --> 00:21:34,127
BROOKE WAS ACTUALLY

872
00:21:34,127 --> 00:21:35,128
PRETTY COMPOSED.

873
00:21:35,128 --> 00:21:36,430
IT WAS REALLY DIFFICULT

874
00:21:36,430 --> 00:21:40,867
BEING FIRST UP.

875
00:21:40,867 --> 00:21:42,169
>> I START WALKING, AND, LIKE,

876
00:21:42,169 --> 00:21:43,337
WHAT THE HELL?

877
00:21:43,337 --> 00:21:44,705
IT, LIKE, STARTS TIPPING,

878
00:21:44,705 --> 00:21:47,407
AND, LIKE, I ALMOST FALL IN.

879
00:21:47,407 --> 00:21:49,109
>> ALL RIGHT, SHE NAILED IT!

880
00:21:49,109 --> 00:21:50,911
HER FOOTWORK WAS A LITTLE OFF,

881
00:21:50,911 --> 00:21:51,945
BUT OVERALL,

882
00:21:51,945 --> 00:21:53,447
JAEDA HELD HER COMPOSURE,

883
00:21:53,447 --> 00:21:54,448
AND I WAS REALLY IMPRESSED

884
00:21:54,448 --> 00:21:55,449
BY THAT.

885
00:21:55,449 --> 00:21:56,917
DON'T SLOW IT DOWN!

886
00:21:56,917 --> 00:21:58,085
DON'T SLOW IT DOWN.

887
00:21:58,085 --> 00:22:01,788
YOU GOTTA KEEP IT UP.

888
