I KEPT GOING AFTER I FELL OFF.

940
00:23:25,320 --> 00:23:27,121
I JUST KEPT GOING.

941
00:23:27,121 --> 00:23:29,090
I'M FRICKIN' BLEEDING!

942
00:23:29,090 --> 00:23:30,558
